# The demo image (packages/demo/Dockerfile) needs only these three packages. Everything else,
# including .git, local virtualenvs, traces and results, stays out of the build context.
*
!packages/core/
!packages/voice/
!packages/demo/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
packages/core/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
